  "properties": {
    "title": "Data Collection Using KoboToolbox",
    "description": "The workshop aims to orient participants on the features and use of KoboCollect, an open-source ODK collect mobile application that could gather primary data for mapping and building a database for different exposure elements.\n\nIn this workshop, the topics covered are creating a kobo toolbox account, crafting forms in the kobo toolbox, setting up your kobo collect application, collecting field data with kobo collect, uploading forms with kobo collect, and building forms with XLS form.",
